Prebuilt kernel for the Galaxy S8+ Exynos (SM-G955F, dream2lte).

  Image   Samsung 4.4.302 universal8895 kernel, android_kernel_samsung_universal8895
          branch aosp17 (3160351f), exynos8895-dream2lte_defconfig, GCC 16.1.0
  dt.img  Samsung DTBH image of exynos8895-dream2lte_eur_open_10.dtb

Rebuild with ./build-kernel.sh <path to kernel source>.
